msgid "What's Next?"
msgstr "다음 단계"

msgid ""
"Next, [Sim-to-Real Strategy 5: System Identification With AnchorBench](15-strategy4-sysid.md) "
"examines the actuation gap through measured SO-101 motions, fitted actuator parameters, and a "
"paired policy comparison."
msgstr ""
"다음 [Sim-to-Real Strategy 5: System Identification With AnchorBench](15-strategy4-sysid.md)에서는 "
"SO-101 측정 motion, fitted actuator parameter, paired policy 비교로 actuation gap을 살펴봅니다."

